{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ef574df1-9989-862a-bf1b-5bfbad01eae1",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T18:51:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Cristina Silva",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:48:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:48:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. Um, I know it's after hours, City Hall's closed, but the recording said to use this line for flooding. So, I'm calling about a drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:48:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you're in the right place. Go ahead, where's the trouble?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:48:52-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Hold on, I wrote it down. [pause] It's, um, the low spot at the end of the block on Ruggles Avenue. I'm at 274. The whole corner is under about a foot of water. A foot. And this is three days after the storm, the one Friday and Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:49:12-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A foot, okay. Taking that down. Near 274 Ruggles, end of the block, standing water since the weekend storm. Is the drain visible at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:49:23-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you can't see the grate. It's just brown water. And the sidewalk, it's a sheet of mud and grit all the way along. Nobody can walk it. My tenants have to step out into the street, and I keep telling myself somebody will come, and nobody has."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:49:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's no good, especially with the dark out there at this hour. Is the water getting near any of the houses, or is it staying in the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:49:55-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the road and the sidewalk so far. Let me find my place. [pause] Sorry, I'm reading off my notes on my phone. I use a magnifier app to read the small print, so I'm scrolling around. Anyway, it's the same spot, it clogs with grit and leaves and just sits there. I've been waiting since Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:50:18-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put it in as a drain blocked with debris and standing water, sidewalk covered in silt. Crews have been working through a long list since the storm, but I'll flag this one so it's on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:50:34-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, but I'd really like it to actually get done this time. Can somebody call me back when it's cleared? I don't want to find out by looking out the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:50:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. What's the best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:50:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0188. That's the landline, and it's me, Cristina Silva."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:50:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0188, Cristina Silva. Callback once the drain's cleared. I'll note that it's the corner at the end of the block by 274 Ruggles."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:51:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:51:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Have a good night."
    }
  ],
